+# bubble-sort
+
+Small, educational bubble-sort implementation with a tiny CLI.
+
+## Library
+
+```py
+from bubble_sort import bubble_sort, bubble_sort_in_place
+
+print(bubble_sort([3, 1, 2]))  # [1, 2, 3]
+items = [3, 1, 2]
+bubble_sort_in_place(items)
+print(items)  # [1, 2, 3]
+```
+
+## CLI
+
+```bash
+python -m bubble_sort 3 1 2
+echo "3 1 2" | python -m bubble_sort
+python -m bubble_sort b a --type str
+python -m bubble_sort 3 1 2 --reverse --json
+```
+
+## Legacy
+
+`sort.py` keeps the old `bubbleSort(...)` name as a compatibility wrapper.
+
